'''Maarselok''' is a [[Online:Dragon|Dragon]] located in [[Online:Lair of Maarselok|Lair of Maarselok]]. His influence corrupts the Green, as he is imbued with a mysterious disease known as the Azure Blight. Maarselok seeks to corrupt [[Online:Selene|Selene]], a [[Lore:Changeling|Changeling]] with close ties to [[Lore:Shagrath|Shagrath]], so that he could shape the world to his liking with her powers.

For centuries, Maarselok slept deep in the mountains between [[Lore:Elsweyr|Elsweyr]] and [[ON:Grahtwood|Grahtwood]]. However, upon the opening of the [[ON:Halls of Colossus|Halls of Colossus]], this monstrous Dragon has awoken as a consequence of the release of his brethren.{{Ref|name=U23|[https://www.elderscrollsonline.com/en-us/news/post/56573 Scalebreaker and Update 23 Preview]}} Hungry and vengeful, Maarselok has ravaged the wilds and now threatens to spread his corruption into the domain of Valenwood, risking the infection of the Elden Tree if left unchecked.{{Ref|name=DungeonPreview|[https://www.elderscrollsonline.com/en-us/news/post/56765 Face the Corrupting Influence of a New Dragon in Lair of Maarselok]}}
{{NewLeft}}

